{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55221","headline":"题南岳山七言（直在江南） · 李存勖","name":"题南岳山七言（直在江南）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"融峰绝顶九霄边，独立孤峦势近天。\n北眺洞庭千里浪，南观石{石禀}万坡烟。\n云藏碧涧泉声远，僧迫金乌耳伴喧。\n唯有此山侵上界，姮娥吹瑟古松前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李存勖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}